# Each deck described as it stands: made for the 1st edition, awaiting renewal by the slide lineage.

<http://example.org/sen0414/materials> a owl:Ontology ; rdfs:label "SEN0414: teaching materials"@en ;
    owl:versionInfo "1.37.0" ; owl:versionIRI <http://example.org/sen0414/materials/1.37.0> ; owl:priorVersion <http://example.org/sen0414/materials/1.36.0> ;
    dcterms:identifier "sen0414_materials_v1_37_0" ;
    rdfs:comment "Released as 1.14.0 on 2026-09-25: this record had been changed in place across 13 releases (sen0414-v2.10.0 to v2.22.0) while keeping the name v1_0_0; each of those changes added or repointed page entries, so each counts as a MINOR step. Now also names the renamed decks and legacy slides. 1.23.0 adds the chapter 5 deck, RDODI document and page, and corrects the version this record states inside itself: the files named v1_20_0 and v1_21_0 still said 1.19.0. 1.24.0 points the chapter 5 page at version 9.9 (SPARQL samples load on selection, formatted agent answers, an on-request question builder covering every concept). 1.25.0 points the pages of chapters 1 to 5 at version 9.10 (the chapter 5 page adds a written question bank and a live-model question), the decks of chapters 1 to 4 at their repaired files, and the page ABoxes of chapters 1 to 4 at new files. 1.26.0 adds the chapter 6 deck, RDODI document and page, and points the chapter 5 page at version 9.11. 1.27.0 points the pages of chapters 1 to 4 at version 9.11 (each with a written question bank of 61, 54, 69 and 74 items) and their page ABoxes at new files. 1.28.0 points the pages of chapters 1 to 6 at version 9.12 (clickable references, a page-wide search, a check on the local model's replies) and their page ABoxes at new files. 1.29.0 points the pages of chapters 1 to 6 at version 9.13 (progress, a review queue, section links, notes, a cheat sheet, marks on answers, code exercises) and their page ABoxes at new files. 1.30.0 points the pages of chapters 1 to 6 at version 9.14 (ten question types with corrections, mock midterm and final exams from a code, a choice of live model) and their page ABoxes at new files. 1.31.0 corrects three statements this record made about itself. The pages of chapters 1 to 5 are repointed from version 9.14 to the version 9.24 files that are on disk, and the chapter 6 page from version 9.14 to its own 9.19 file, so a query asking where this chapter's page is no longer answers with a file ten versions old. The five renewed decks are repointed at their current files, including the chapter 1, 2 and 3 decks reworked as lectures. The chapter 5 deck and page are recorded as serving the course outcome LO-6, which the approved outcomes ontology sources to chapter 5 of the 3rd edition and which this record had not carried; and every chapter page now names its own deck through dcterms:relation, so the deck that sits beside it is reachable from the register rather than from nowhere. No vocabulary term is added or removed. | 1.37.0 (2026-10-08): the five chapter pages repointed to version 9.27.0 - the two-fold look-and-feel (CME materials standard 1.0.0) with the story layer, the Learn sections, concept map, ontology-graph layers, chapter ERD, fit, reading area, relocate on every diagram and the narrative diagrams typed by the CME narrative-to-diagram mapping, ported from the proven template series onto this course's line (templates 9.26.0-9.37.0); the entries had still named 9.24.0 while the released pages were 9.26.0."@en .

