    cme:renewalStatus "Renewed as a lecture: 30 slides with a talk track in the speaker notes, click-by-click builds and 25 visuals (list boxes with indexes, slices, before-and-after lanes, names reaching objects, a sort-key row, a loop that changes its list, the Matrix frames, a histogram) drawn from executed specifications that the interactive page also draws; 15 expressions, 4 program runs and 621 visual values re-executed under Python 3.14.4 by 08-tooling/ch06-deck. The 1st edition covered lists in its chapter 4, so this deck renews sen0414:Deck_10" ;
